WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.155
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.425 --> 00:19.565
(Jung Yong Hwa)

3
00:19.625 --> 00:22.695
(Hong Seung Hee)

4
00:22.765 --> 00:25.935
(Lee Yi Kyung)

5
00:27.075 --> 00:29.175
(Park Yu Na)

6
00:36.685 --> 00:40.025
(Oh! My Guard)

7
00:40.085 --> 00:41.485
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

8
00:41.555 --> 00:43.025
(Also, children and animals were filmed under production guidelines.)

9
00:46.995 --> 00:48.395
Why is my heart beating so fast?

10
00:49.665 --> 00:51.165
Is it just beating for no reason?

11
01:19.865 --> 01:21.065
I really found him.

12
01:24.395 --> 01:25.465
My father.

13
01:48.855 --> 01:50.555
You are my father, right?

14
01:50.625 --> 01:52.755
You really are my father, right?

15
01:52.825 --> 01:54.125
Hey, what is wrong with you?

16
01:55.225 --> 01:58.535
You have the wrong person. Go away.

17
01:58.595 --> 02:00.165
My Young Ji.

18
02:00.235 --> 02:04.605
No, no, not Young Ji. I am your daughter.

19
02:04.675 --> 02:05.675
Your daughter Hong Du...

20
02:05.735 --> 02:08.675
- No, let go of me. - What should I do?

21
02:08.745 --> 02:09.845
Crazy woman.

22
02:13.385 --> 02:14.585
Father?

23
02:15.085 --> 02:16.085
Father.

24
02:35.765 --> 02:38.105
(Episode 5)

25
02:40.375 --> 02:43.545
You still have a lot of energy, sir.

26
02:46.985 --> 02:48.015
I saw you...

27
02:49.085 --> 02:50.655
at the hospital before.

28
03:01.025 --> 03:02.025
Ta-da.

29
03:02.095 --> 03:03.465
(The Cocky Detective and Con Artist)

30
03:03.765 --> 03:06.435
I play the con artist in this project.

31
03:06.505 --> 03:09.435
Na Ri, your face is unbelievably gorgeous.

32
03:09.505 --> 03:11.205
I suppose I am.

33
03:11.275 --> 03:15.105
Um Tae Bong plays the detective chasing me.

34
03:15.175 --> 03:17.875
Everyone, you will give our drama a lot of love, right?

35
03:17.945 --> 03:20.085
Um Tae Bong will dump you after the drama ends.

36
03:21.885 --> 03:23.515
Actually, in the show, my soul...

37
03:23.585 --> 03:27.225
- enters his body. - Are you two really dating?

38
03:27.285 --> 03:28.555
That is so sad.

39
03:31.495 --> 03:33.265
It is true that we are dating, but...

40
03:33.325 --> 03:35.525
you all are much, much more precious to...

41
03:35.595 --> 03:38.365
No, they are probably not actually dating.

42
03:38.435 --> 03:40.135
It is all a lie.

43
03:41.665 --> 03:43.235
No, it is not.

44
03:43.305 --> 03:44.475
We really are dating.

45
03:44.535 --> 03:47.545
They have not even kissed. Really? No kissing means no dating.

46
03:47.605 --> 03:49.445
But why does Um Tae Bong not kiss in dramas?

47
03:49.505 --> 03:51.715
It is not that he does not do it, maybe he cannot do it?

48
03:51.775 --> 03:55.145
Is Um Tae Bong a defective human who cannot kiss?

49
03:55.215 --> 03:57.985
Hey, you, I am going to kick you out. Okay?

50
03:58.055 --> 04:00.785
He is not unable to kiss, okay? I would know.

51
04:00.855 --> 04:02.585
If you are really dating, reveal the secret...

52
04:02.655 --> 04:04.995
why Um Tae Bong does not film kiss scenes.

53
04:05.055 --> 04:07.325
Reveal it and we will believe you. If you are offended, drop dead.

54
04:08.325 --> 04:10.695
A Romance Master who cannot kiss? That is disgusting.

55
04:10.765 --> 04:12.235
Disgusting.

56
04:12.295 --> 04:14.905
You guys are more disgusting. Get out, all of you.

57
04:17.335 --> 04:19.075
(Na Ri TV has ended the broadcast.)

58
04:21.145 --> 04:22.575
There is definitely something going on.

59
04:30.385 --> 04:31.985
Oh my, when a man and a woman...

60
04:32.055 --> 04:34.285
see each other too often, they get attached.

61
04:34.355 --> 04:36.355
I will get straight to the point.

62
04:36.425 --> 04:38.955
This woman next to Um Tae Bong.

63
04:39.025 --> 04:41.225
This person is...

64
04:41.295 --> 04:44.335
Oh, is she a woman you know too, CEO Park?

65
04:44.395 --> 04:46.335
The fact they were photographed together at night...

66
04:46.405 --> 04:48.505
means she definitely has a special relationship with Um Star.

67
04:48.565 --> 04:49.565
No.

68
04:50.635 --> 04:52.005
She demanded money.

69
04:52.075 --> 04:54.545
In exchange for revealing the secret of why he does not film kiss scenes.

70
04:54.605 --> 04:56.175
Who? This person?

71
04:56.245 --> 04:58.145
We are supposed to meet this evening, but...

72
04:58.215 --> 05:01.815
I still have some loyalty. I came to you first, CEO Park.

73
05:01.885 --> 05:04.785
To see if you can persuade me.

74
05:04.855 --> 05:06.555
What is it, really?

75
05:06.625 --> 05:07.985
Um Star is hiding something, isn't he?

76
05:08.055 --> 05:09.185
Some unspeakable secret.

77
05:14.095 --> 05:15.095
Reporter Yeo.

78
05:28.545 --> 05:29.815
Oh, seriously.

79
05:29.875 --> 05:32.275
Asked for money? You have got the wrong person.

80
05:32.345 --> 05:35.545
She is not the type to make a deal using Tae Bong's secret.

81
05:35.615 --> 05:37.315
Oh, man, seriously.

82
05:37.385 --> 05:39.585
Man, I almost fell for that for a second.

83
05:39.655 --> 05:42.225
Nice try. I am busy, so I will be going.

84
05:42.285 --> 05:45.325
Okay. I admit my plan failed.

85
05:45.395 --> 05:47.795
But you almost fell for it?

86
05:49.065 --> 05:50.395
Then I got one thing out of this.

87
05:54.035 --> 05:58.505
That this woman might actually know Um Star's real secret?

88
05:58.575 --> 06:00.005
Are you not getting out? I am the one...

89
06:00.075 --> 06:01.075
who is actually busy now.

90
06:08.285 --> 06:09.285
Son of a...

91
06:15.555 --> 06:16.555
Here,

92
06:17.655 --> 06:18.655
I couldn't give this to you earlier.

93
06:19.995 --> 06:21.765
But what are you doing here?

94
06:21.825 --> 06:26.335
- I really saw my father earlier. - There you go again. Oh, man.

95
06:30.435 --> 06:31.675
This.

96
06:31.735 --> 06:34.075
Dementia nursing hospital?

97
06:34.145 --> 06:36.175
- This is... - It was on my father's arm earlier.

98
06:36.245 --> 06:39.615
Now it all makes sense. My father didn't die. He was just sick.

99
06:39.675 --> 06:41.285
If I search every nursing hospital in Seoul,

100
06:41.345 --> 06:42.345
I can find him.

101
06:45.315 --> 06:46.415
Do whatever you want, then.

102
06:48.225 --> 06:49.995
I shouldn't hate my father anymore.

103
06:52.125 --> 06:55.795
I missed him so much that I really hated him.

104
06:58.265 --> 06:59.395
But now...

105
07:01.635 --> 07:02.665
I don't hate him.

106
07:32.095 --> 07:34.465
Hey, Tae Bong, we have a big problem.

107
07:34.535 --> 07:35.605
Oh, Mr. Choi.

108
07:36.875 --> 07:37.875
Mr. Choi?

109
07:39.335 --> 07:40.675
What is Mr. Choi Gu doing here?

110
07:42.205 --> 07:44.345
Cha Hong Du is looking for him.

111
07:44.415 --> 07:46.475
- What? - This was it.

112
07:46.545 --> 07:48.215
The whole story behind the fake world...

113
07:49.315 --> 07:50.315
that Cha Hong Du believes in.

114
07:50.385 --> 07:52.955
Wait, so why is Hong Du looking for him?

115
07:54.725 --> 07:56.795
Don't tell me she thinks he is her father?

116
08:00.595 --> 08:01.825
She is a woman who makes up context...

117
08:01.895 --> 08:04.965
- out of thin air. - I don't know how...

118
08:05.035 --> 08:06.565
Reporter Yeo Mi Ran caught on,

119
08:06.635 --> 08:09.535
but she knows that Hong Du knows your secret.

120
08:10.605 --> 08:12.575
- What? - She is going to find Hong Du...

121
08:12.635 --> 08:14.745
and make her talk.

122
08:14.805 --> 08:18.075
But does Hong Du really know your secret?

123
08:18.145 --> 08:19.515
The day you wore that paper bag over your head,

124
08:19.575 --> 08:22.315
did something actually happen between you two?

125
08:22.385 --> 08:23.885
What are you talking about?

126
08:23.955 --> 08:25.515
Cha Hong Du blackmailed you.

127
08:27.225 --> 08:29.585
Right, she did.

128
08:29.655 --> 08:31.295
Anyway, it is dangerous.

129
08:31.355 --> 08:34.165
Like you said, she is someone who makes up context out of thin air.

130
08:34.225 --> 08:35.225
It is dangerous, so dangerous.

131
08:35.295 --> 08:37.995
Who knows what kind of unpredictable trouble she will cause...

132
08:41.835 --> 08:43.205
I haven't found him yet,

133
08:44.375 --> 08:46.375
but I will soon.

134
08:46.435 --> 08:48.275
But it is a real miracle.

135
08:48.345 --> 08:50.875
You reunited with your father who you thought passed away.

136
08:50.945 --> 08:52.615
I know, right?

137
08:52.675 --> 08:53.945
Ever since I woke up in the hospital,

138
08:54.015 --> 08:55.315
only good things have been happening.

139
08:55.385 --> 08:57.355
I am working again,

140
08:57.415 --> 08:59.315
and I found out my father is alive.

141
09:03.055 --> 09:04.925
Why are you leaving me out?

142
09:09.595 --> 09:12.835
The best thing of all is...

143
09:12.895 --> 09:14.535
getting a good neighbor?

144
09:14.605 --> 09:15.605
A neighbor?

145
09:18.335 --> 09:19.335
What is that?

146
09:27.985 --> 09:28.985
Give it here.

147
09:30.715 --> 09:32.615
I thought you lived off these when you worked part-time.

148
09:33.825 --> 09:34.825
Tell me the truth.

149
09:34.825 --> 09:36.725
Are you actually a conglomerate heiress?

150
09:36.795 --> 09:37.925
And you have never eaten anything like this?

151
09:39.325 --> 09:41.425
How did you know? Actually...

152
09:44.965 --> 09:49.435
I just temporarily...

153
09:49.505 --> 09:51.535
escaped from my castle.

154
09:51.605 --> 09:52.605
I knew it.

155
09:54.845 --> 09:55.975
Which castle is it?

156
09:57.115 --> 09:58.515
Just tell me. It will be our secret.

157
10:00.185 --> 10:01.845
This is a huge secret, but...

158
10:03.355 --> 10:04.355
Actually...

159
10:05.385 --> 10:06.415
It is Mr. Han's company.

160
10:15.665 --> 10:17.135
Then you must be Oh Hae Ra, Hong Du.

161
10:18.195 --> 10:19.895
Oh Hae Ra? Who is that?

162
10:24.335 --> 10:26.675
The one you said you really wanted to be friends with last time?

163
10:26.745 --> 10:28.305
You are completely obsessed with her.

164
10:28.375 --> 10:29.445
You do not even know what she looks like.

165
10:30.975 --> 10:32.445
Oh Hae Ra...

166
10:32.515 --> 10:34.945
If we ever meet, she will fall right for me.

167
10:38.715 --> 10:40.855
Wow, you are so full of yourself.

168
10:40.925 --> 10:42.425
I will go wash this off.

169
10:46.995 --> 10:48.025
She is cute.

170
10:54.105 --> 10:56.505
(Evil Employer)

171
11:01.475 --> 11:02.475
Yes, hello...

172
11:02.545 --> 11:05.345
I am only going to ask you this one last time,

173
11:05.415 --> 11:07.385
so you are dead if you lie.

174
11:07.445 --> 11:12.315
Did you really blackmail CEO Park? It just does not make any sense.

175
11:12.385 --> 11:14.085
Why did you play dumb with me after doing that?

176
11:15.125 --> 11:16.755
Do you...

177
11:16.825 --> 11:20.325
actually know my secret, or not?

178
11:20.395 --> 11:21.395
Are you not going to answer?

179
11:23.565 --> 11:25.265
You are not giving me a chance to speak.

180
11:27.935 --> 11:30.175
Who are you?

181
11:30.235 --> 11:31.235
Where is Cha Hong Du?

182
11:31.305 --> 11:34.575
I am someone who lives with Hong Du. As for Hong Du,

183
11:37.075 --> 11:38.215
she went to wash up.

184
11:39.245 --> 11:41.185
What? Wash up?

185
11:41.245 --> 11:43.455
Yes. She is taking a while.

186
11:43.515 --> 11:45.255
She must be washing thoroughly.

187
11:46.715 --> 11:49.155
- What? Thoroughly? - When Hong Du gets back,

188
11:49.225 --> 11:50.225
should I just pass on what you said?

189
11:51.495 --> 11:52.495
What was it again?

190
11:52.555 --> 11:55.195
Hong Du is a blackmailer who knows your secret.

191
11:56.965 --> 11:59.535
And you lack comprehension skills.

192
11:59.595 --> 12:00.605
Right?

193
12:01.605 --> 12:04.705
When did I say I had a secret?

194
12:04.775 --> 12:07.045
Wow, you really have a habit...

195
12:07.105 --> 12:08.545
of misunderstanding people, don't you?

196
12:08.605 --> 12:11.975
By the way, are you Hong Du's employer?

197
12:12.045 --> 12:14.015
I have heard a lot about you.

198
12:14.085 --> 12:15.345
Is that so?

199
12:15.415 --> 12:18.115
Well, I have never heard a single thing about you.

200
12:19.155 --> 12:23.125
But have we met somewhere before?

201
12:23.185 --> 12:24.695
Your voice sounds very familiar...

202
12:26.395 --> 12:27.395
Hello...

203
12:37.205 --> 12:38.575
Excuse me, Hong Du?

204
12:38.635 --> 12:39.935
Have you never mentioned me to your employer?

205
12:40.005 --> 12:41.705
What?

206
12:41.775 --> 12:43.575
Why do you ask?

207
12:43.645 --> 12:46.515
Why are you being like this? My feelings are completely hurt.

208
12:48.015 --> 12:49.945
What? Well...

209
12:53.085 --> 12:54.955
We do not have a patient by that name.

210
12:55.025 --> 12:57.695
Cha Gil Dong, we do not have anyone by that name.

211
12:57.755 --> 12:59.195
I do not think so.

212
12:59.255 --> 13:01.365
There is no patient with that name.

213
13:01.425 --> 13:04.135
(Imje Dementia Nursing Hospital)

214
13:04.195 --> 13:06.195
(Emergency)

215
13:27.455 --> 13:30.295
Where did he go?

216
13:30.355 --> 13:32.125
She has been doing that all day.

217
13:34.395 --> 13:36.165
Why am I following her around?

218
13:37.465 --> 13:39.295
It is not like...

219
13:39.365 --> 13:41.065
I am going to let them meet.

220
13:42.065 --> 13:43.335
(Imje Dementia Nursing Hospital)

221
14:24.615 --> 14:27.115
- What are you doing? - What do you think?

222
14:27.185 --> 14:28.385
I am doing nothing.

223
14:29.785 --> 14:31.555
Buy me some food.

224
14:31.615 --> 14:33.255
What?

225
14:33.315 --> 14:35.925
I am craving something so spicy it makes me cry.

226
14:37.425 --> 14:39.495
But I cannot go alone.

227
14:39.555 --> 14:40.725
Well...

228
14:40.795 --> 14:41.795
Sure.

229
14:53.845 --> 14:56.875
Right. Um Tae Bong told me not to cry.

230
14:58.315 --> 15:00.645
Even if something truly makes me want to cry,

231
15:00.715 --> 15:02.385
I just have to...

232
15:02.445 --> 15:03.685
pretend to be okay like this.

233
15:05.085 --> 15:06.215
Pretend to be okay.

234
15:11.025 --> 15:12.525
There you go again.

235
15:12.595 --> 15:14.465
Did I not tell you to always smile?

236
15:28.345 --> 15:30.445
I asked for spicy food, so why a restaurant?

237
15:31.475 --> 15:32.645
But are you not here yet?

238
16:05.745 --> 16:06.745
Father.

239
16:08.385 --> 16:09.385
Crazy woman.

240
16:09.445 --> 16:12.515
I really thought you were dead, Father.

241
16:12.585 --> 16:14.725
Where have you been all this time?

242
16:14.785 --> 16:17.355
Why did you abandon me?

243
16:17.425 --> 16:20.295
CEO Park, restroom. Why is he not coming?

244
16:20.365 --> 16:21.925
Father. It is me, Hong Du.

245
16:21.995 --> 16:24.665
- Your daughter, Hong Du, remember? - Daughter?

246
16:24.735 --> 16:28.165
When I found out you were alive,

247
16:28.235 --> 16:32.605
I searched every single hospital trying to find you, you know?

248
16:34.775 --> 16:36.205
Crazy woman.

249
16:36.275 --> 16:37.745
Are you crying?

250
16:37.815 --> 16:40.745
Why do you keep calling me a crazy woman?

251
16:40.815 --> 16:41.885
Seriously.

252
16:43.045 --> 16:46.185
Why do you not remember me? Why?

253
16:46.255 --> 16:48.155
Are you really sick, Father?

254
16:48.225 --> 16:50.655
- Is that it? - You should not cry.

255
16:51.725 --> 16:53.525
You should not cry.

256
16:53.595 --> 16:56.065
It drains your energy.

257
16:57.365 --> 16:58.795
Still, you should not have forgotten.

258
17:00.065 --> 17:03.905
You should remember your daughter, Hong Du, right?

259
17:03.975 --> 17:06.375
My daughter is Young Ji.

260
17:06.435 --> 17:07.805
It is Young Ji.

261
17:07.875 --> 17:09.945
I am your daughter.

262
17:10.005 --> 17:14.045
I am your daughter, Hong Du.

263
17:17.785 --> 17:18.885
You are not Hong Du.

264
17:19.955 --> 17:21.955
Will it really be okay?

265
17:22.025 --> 17:23.125
You are not Hong Du.

266
17:28.665 --> 17:30.965
Wait, we should bring...

267
17:31.035 --> 17:33.935
- Mr. Choi Gu here. - Why? For what reason, man?

268
17:34.005 --> 17:36.905
If she thinks she confirmed he is alive,

269
17:36.965 --> 17:38.105
she will not cry anymore.

270
17:43.175 --> 17:46.075
It is not like he actually knows Cha Hong Du anyway,

271
17:46.145 --> 17:47.315
so we should just make it look like...

272
17:47.385 --> 17:49.585
- a natural hospital admission. - Hong Du.

273
17:49.645 --> 17:50.815
My Hong Du.

274
17:52.415 --> 17:54.785
The best thing I ever did in my life...

275
17:55.785 --> 17:57.525
was becoming your father, Hong Du.

276
17:58.925 --> 18:01.125
I knew it.

277
18:01.195 --> 18:03.195
Even if you forget everyone else in the world,

278
18:04.835 --> 18:06.395
I knew you would not forget me.

279
18:08.535 --> 18:10.675
- My daughter, Hong Du. - Daughter?

280
18:12.805 --> 18:15.675
- Hey, what do you mean, daughter? - My daughter, Hong Du.

281
18:15.745 --> 18:17.645
Some patients forget reality...

282
18:17.715 --> 18:19.975
and hope to live in a world of their own making.

283
18:20.045 --> 18:22.215
- Choi Gu is that kind of case. - You should not cry.

284
18:22.285 --> 18:23.915
He wants to live in a fictional world...

285
18:23.985 --> 18:25.085
created by his dementia.

286
18:25.155 --> 18:28.985
That world is a mixture of dramas and reality.

287
18:29.055 --> 18:31.195
- Father, what is with your hair? - I did not think of this.

288
18:31.255 --> 18:33.925
Why do you have so much white hair?

289
18:33.995 --> 18:37.765
I will get in trouble if I smell. My daughter Hong Du will scold me.

290
18:37.835 --> 18:40.605
I love your smell, Father. I love everything about you.

291
18:43.165 --> 18:44.975
What is this? Why are you...

292
18:45.035 --> 18:46.905
here so early?

293
18:46.975 --> 18:47.975
I am sorry.

294
18:49.305 --> 18:51.975
Um Tae Bong, I found my father.

295
18:52.045 --> 18:53.885
Say hello, he is my father.

296
18:53.945 --> 18:55.215
My daughter, Hong Du.

297
18:59.585 --> 19:02.655
Wow, how did you happen to meet...

298
19:02.725 --> 19:05.095
Hong Du's father right here?

299
19:05.155 --> 19:07.025
Oh my, I should have greeted you first...

300
19:07.095 --> 19:10.125
You two look alike. Right.

301
19:10.195 --> 19:12.565
See, I was right, was I not?

302
19:12.635 --> 19:14.235
My father was really alive, right?

303
19:17.975 --> 19:19.005
What do we do now?

304
19:37.395 --> 19:41.465
What? You live in a rooftop room?

305
19:41.525 --> 19:42.995
Then the number of rooms is...

306
19:43.065 --> 19:45.765
- Just 1, of course. - Then in 1 room, you and...

307
19:45.835 --> 19:48.135
I mean, you will sleep with your father...

308
19:48.205 --> 19:50.105
No. You will live together?

309
19:50.165 --> 19:51.575
What is wrong with that? When I was young,

310
19:51.635 --> 19:53.035
my father and I lived perfectly fine in a single room.

311
19:53.105 --> 19:54.945
Even so, in one room...

312
19:55.005 --> 19:57.275
I will just find a top-tier...

313
19:57.345 --> 19:59.675
- nursing hospital for him. - No.

314
19:59.745 --> 20:01.115
Do you know how hard it was to reunite with him?

315
20:01.185 --> 20:02.415
Or else,

316
20:02.485 --> 20:03.915
just your father can come to my house...

317
20:03.985 --> 20:05.785
I am never separating from him again.

318
20:05.855 --> 20:08.625
You should go now. Before CEO Park brings my father,

319
20:08.685 --> 20:09.755
I need to do some cleaning.

320
20:11.525 --> 20:14.225
Darn it.

321
20:14.295 --> 20:15.295
What should I do?

322
20:18.835 --> 20:22.735
- Did something happen at my house? - The boiler at your house burst.

323
20:24.005 --> 20:26.505
If the boiler bursts in this freezing weather,

324
20:26.575 --> 20:28.675
even a healthy person will get sick.

325
20:28.745 --> 20:30.945
Do you have somewhere to stay for a few days?

326
20:32.515 --> 20:33.745
What?

327
20:33.815 --> 20:36.545
Right, I need to put this away.

328
20:36.615 --> 20:40.185
Now, The Crown Prince's Bodyguard is...

329
20:40.255 --> 20:41.625
Bodyguard is...

330
20:41.685 --> 20:42.825
right here.

331
20:43.955 --> 20:47.195
From now on, this drama does not exist in this world.

332
20:48.795 --> 20:50.695
Just let her keep believing what she believes...

333
20:50.765 --> 20:53.495
and make sure she stays right by Um Tae Bong's side.

334
20:53.565 --> 20:57.105
Preferably, so she can get close to Um Tae Bong.

335
21:02.805 --> 21:04.715
(Blank Check)

336
21:04.775 --> 21:07.585
(30 Million Dollars)

337
21:09.945 --> 21:13.715
The zeros on this blank check just keep multiplying.

338
21:16.555 --> 21:17.595
Oh, man.

339
21:21.195 --> 21:22.195
Just because you found your father,

340
21:22.265 --> 21:24.065
you are not going to neglect me, right?

341
21:24.135 --> 21:26.535
What if that underground parking lot incident happens again?

342
21:26.595 --> 21:30.165
Stick even closer to me for the time being.

343
21:30.235 --> 21:32.035
Both you and your father.

344
21:35.445 --> 21:37.415
You see the biggest room over there?

345
21:37.475 --> 21:40.785
That is my room. Which means it is a restricted area.

346
21:42.015 --> 21:43.685
The room next to it is yours.

347
21:46.415 --> 21:48.125
The one at the end is Mr. Choi's room.

348
21:49.125 --> 21:51.395
No, the room your father will use.

349
21:52.595 --> 21:53.755
Is that my room?

350
21:55.125 --> 21:57.195
- Follow him. - Right, got it.

351
21:57.265 --> 21:58.865
Sir, let us go together.

352
22:00.535 --> 22:03.035
Well, I came because the boiler burst, but...

353
22:03.105 --> 22:04.405
it is not my house, so it is uncomfort...

354
22:04.475 --> 22:06.505
If it is uncomfortable, you can go back.

355
22:06.575 --> 22:09.275
Who said it was uncomfortable? I am completely comfortable.

356
22:09.345 --> 22:10.445
Look.

357
22:10.505 --> 22:13.375
I am already completely one with this sofa.

358
22:15.985 --> 22:17.955
Oh, did you receive all of these?

359
22:18.015 --> 22:19.555
Do not touch that.

360
22:19.615 --> 22:22.785
Absolutely no touching my prized possessions.

361
22:22.855 --> 22:23.855
And above all...

362
22:26.355 --> 22:29.525
That bathroom is off-limits.

363
22:29.595 --> 22:32.095
Your bathroom is over there.

364
22:32.165 --> 22:33.665
What, is it plated in gold or something?

365
22:33.735 --> 22:35.735
It is in a different class.

366
22:35.805 --> 22:39.835
My hobby is taking a bubble bath while reading TIME magazine...

367
22:39.905 --> 22:41.205
Are these all the dramas you starred in?

368
22:41.275 --> 22:42.845
Hey, I am talking here.

369
22:43.205 --> 22:44.445
(The Crown Prince's...)

370
22:45.615 --> 22:46.615
What...

371
22:47.145 --> 22:48.145
(The Crown Prince's...)

372
22:53.355 --> 22:55.085
What was that just now?

373
22:55.155 --> 22:56.155
What was what?

374
22:58.025 --> 22:59.425
The thing you hid behind your back.

375
22:59.495 --> 23:01.525
Hid what?

376
23:07.565 --> 23:10.035
- So that is what it is. - What is what?

377
23:10.105 --> 23:14.105
You know, that thing. Men's...

378
23:14.175 --> 23:17.575
- private lives. - Hey, I am not that kind of guy.

379
23:17.645 --> 23:19.875
What kind of person do you take me for?

380
23:19.945 --> 23:20.945
Anyway...

381
23:22.215 --> 23:25.315
The house rules are simple.

382
23:25.385 --> 23:29.685
Absolutely do not touch anything.

383
23:30.725 --> 23:31.995
I will not touch anything.

384
23:38.465 --> 23:41.535
This is totally like the movie Mission Impossible, right?

385
23:41.605 --> 23:43.965
- Right? Tom Cruise. - Gosh.

386
23:44.475 --> 23:45.605
("The Crown Prince's Bodyguard")

387
23:45.905 --> 23:47.875
- Finding this hilarious, are you? - Hey.

388
23:47.945 --> 23:50.675
You know, life is a tragedy when seen from afar...

389
23:50.745 --> 23:52.645
but an even bigger tragedy up close.

390
23:54.685 --> 23:56.885
Did I kill Cha Hong Du in my past life?

391
23:56.945 --> 23:58.515
Or maybe Hong Du saved yours.

392
24:00.755 --> 24:03.885
Hey, by the way, it's been quiet lately, hasn't it?

393
24:03.955 --> 24:05.355
That stalker.

394
24:05.425 --> 24:08.725
If you think about it, this is all because of that jerk.

395
24:08.795 --> 24:10.125
Man.

396
24:10.195 --> 24:12.995
Anyway, we should be thankful it's quiet.

397
24:13.065 --> 24:14.065
It's a blessing.

398
24:43.525 --> 24:44.535
Father.

399
24:49.935 --> 24:51.035
Let's never...

400
24:52.805 --> 24:54.005
be apart again.

401
25:18.165 --> 25:20.865
Mr. Han, I found my father.

402
25:20.935 --> 25:23.235
We'll be living at my employer's house for a while,

403
25:23.305 --> 25:25.775
so don't cry because I'm not there.

404
25:25.835 --> 25:27.275
You have to promise.

405
25:38.215 --> 25:39.685
To celebrate you finding your father,

406
25:41.255 --> 25:43.255
I was going to teach you how to drink today.

407
25:46.425 --> 25:48.225
Congratulations, really.

408
25:48.295 --> 25:50.895
Make sure to talk about me a lot to your employer.

409
25:50.965 --> 25:54.905
First he wants to be friends with a woman he's never seen...

410
25:54.965 --> 25:56.565
named Oh Hae Ra or whatever.

411
25:57.905 --> 26:01.305
Don't tell me he wants to be friends with Um Tae Bong too.

412
26:05.875 --> 26:07.985
Like I'd ever tell him my employer is Um Tae Bong.

413
26:30.935 --> 26:34.135
It's so boring without her here.

414
26:36.375 --> 26:38.315
So boring.

415
26:41.985 --> 26:44.485
Really boring.

416
26:52.995 --> 26:54.665
Why can't I fall asleep?

417
26:56.265 --> 26:58.335
Don't tell me...

418
26:58.395 --> 27:01.005
Is it because I'm living in the same house as that jerk?

419
27:03.105 --> 27:05.535
No, no...

420
27:10.275 --> 27:11.275
Oh, right.

421
27:12.675 --> 27:14.815
Father kicks his blankets off in his sleep.

422
27:41.705 --> 27:44.045
Why are you snooping around my room in the middle of the night?

423
27:44.105 --> 27:45.515
Well...

424
27:45.575 --> 27:48.045
Who's snooping? I just...

425
27:48.115 --> 27:50.585
- I couldn't sleep... - You couldn't sleep?

426
27:52.015 --> 27:53.355
Because you're nervous?

427
27:53.415 --> 27:55.425
Thinking about sleeping in the same house as me.

428
27:55.485 --> 27:57.755
- Can't breathe? - I thought I heard...

429
27:57.825 --> 27:59.555
a dog barking somewhere.

430
28:10.265 --> 28:11.305
Cha Hong Du.

431
28:15.905 --> 28:17.245
Why are you looking at me like that?

432
28:19.415 --> 28:21.715
Do you happen to...

433
28:21.785 --> 28:23.385
have another name...

434
28:25.155 --> 28:26.815
besides Cha Hong Du?

435
28:26.885 --> 28:29.255
Another name? No.

436
28:29.325 --> 28:32.325
Then maybe who you are right now...

437
28:33.525 --> 28:36.025
isn't the real you.

438
28:37.065 --> 28:38.995
Just a thought.

439
28:39.065 --> 28:41.135
Speak Korean.

440
28:41.205 --> 28:42.435
I mean,

441
28:43.505 --> 28:48.045
like you went through a shock so big that you wanted to forget reality...

442
28:48.105 --> 28:49.445
or something like that.

443
28:51.245 --> 28:53.775
I need to know how you ended up like this...

444
28:53.845 --> 28:54.845
so I can...

445
28:54.915 --> 28:56.845
decide whether to keep you around.

446
28:58.455 --> 29:00.255
How did I end up?

447
29:00.315 --> 29:02.585
Are you rubbing it in that you let my father stay here?

448
29:02.655 --> 29:03.985
That is not it.

449
29:06.095 --> 29:08.565
Just try to remember.

450
29:08.625 --> 29:10.495
Anything...

451
29:10.565 --> 29:12.465
that completely changed your life,

452
29:13.565 --> 29:15.365
if anything like that happened.

453
29:15.435 --> 29:17.005
There is something.

454
29:17.065 --> 29:18.735
There is?

455
29:18.805 --> 29:20.675
You.

456
29:20.735 --> 29:23.175
The day I first met you.

457
29:23.245 --> 29:25.015
If I had not saved you back then,

458
29:26.015 --> 29:27.985
my life would not have gotten so complicated.

459
29:30.585 --> 29:31.855
But I do not regret it.

460
29:32.855 --> 29:34.215
Because I am not alone anymore.

461
29:43.825 --> 29:45.095
I am suddenly tired.

462
29:46.095 --> 29:47.465
I am going in first.

463
30:00.045 --> 30:01.045
It is hot.

464
30:17.565 --> 30:20.495
- Jae Hee, time to eat. - Hey, kid.

465
30:20.565 --> 30:23.505
Did you just move here? What is your name? Do you want to play together?

466
30:25.705 --> 30:27.735
Do not cry.

467
30:27.805 --> 30:29.005
Do not cry.

468
30:31.315 --> 30:33.715
It is all my fault. I am so sorry.

469
30:45.095 --> 30:46.555
This is the first time...

470
30:48.465 --> 30:49.995
she appeared in my dreams...

471
31:00.435 --> 31:02.205
What is all that noise?

472
31:04.505 --> 31:05.515
What?

473
31:11.215 --> 31:12.255
Darn it.

474
31:13.715 --> 31:15.625
Do you not know I do not eat breakfast?

475
31:15.685 --> 31:16.885
This...

476
31:16.955 --> 31:19.895
- What is the point of this mess? - Noodle soup.

477
31:19.955 --> 31:21.965
It is my father's favorite.

478
31:22.025 --> 31:24.425
Is his favorite the knife or the noodles?

479
31:24.495 --> 31:26.795
Because either way, it looks pretty dangerous.

480
31:30.405 --> 31:31.705
I am holding a knife right now.

481
31:35.245 --> 31:36.675
Put it down. Put it down.

482
31:42.785 --> 31:43.785
Where is mine?

483
31:43.845 --> 31:45.255
I thought you did not eat breakfast.

484
31:45.315 --> 31:48.325
Does your life always go exactly as you plan?

485
31:54.765 --> 31:56.395
Hey, did you make this with your feet?

486
31:56.465 --> 31:57.965
It tastes awful, seriously.

487
31:59.595 --> 32:00.765
Do not eat it then.

488
32:02.805 --> 32:05.275
Fine. Eat up.

489
32:08.545 --> 32:10.905
I will enjoy the meal too.

490
32:16.185 --> 32:20.115
Sir, are you not going to eat more? This place is really good.

491
32:20.185 --> 32:23.485
If I eat flour, my blood sugar spikes immediately,

492
32:23.555 --> 32:25.155
and it makes filming a bit difficult.

493
32:31.735 --> 32:34.865
Are you crazy? What are you doing right now?

494
32:34.935 --> 32:36.805
It tastes too bad. It is too dangerous.

495
32:36.865 --> 32:37.865
So things like this...

496
32:37.935 --> 32:41.035
- I have to eat them for you... - Hey.

497
32:41.105 --> 32:45.175
Do not mess with our Hong Du. You Hong Du Leech.

498
32:45.245 --> 32:46.675
A leech?

499
32:46.745 --> 32:48.645
Because you are stuck right onto our Hong Du,

500
32:48.715 --> 32:50.085
you are a Leech.

501
32:51.185 --> 32:55.225
My father always had a great eye for people.

502
32:58.725 --> 33:02.595
Then enjoy your meal, and you can do the dishes.

503
33:02.665 --> 33:03.695
What?

504
33:03.765 --> 33:06.195
Do what? Hey, you get out.

505
33:06.265 --> 33:07.335
Get out.

506
33:07.335 --> 33:09.565
Sir, I am Tae Bong.

507
33:09.635 --> 33:14.405
- Whose side are you on? - Be quiet, you chatterbox leech.

508
33:14.475 --> 33:15.945
No, you cannot do this.

509
33:16.005 --> 33:17.505
No!

510
33:22.045 --> 33:25.155
(30 Million Dollars)

511
33:29.325 --> 33:30.325
(Blank Check)

512
33:34.525 --> 33:35.525
But this...

513
33:35.595 --> 33:37.825
There are too many zeros, right?

514
33:39.965 --> 33:41.635
Should I erase just one, then?

515
33:41.705 --> 33:42.835
Yes. I will do that.

516
33:44.605 --> 33:46.475
I will just do this...

517
33:58.785 --> 33:59.955
Yes, right...

518
34:00.015 --> 34:01.555
Two...

519
34:01.625 --> 34:02.825
Understood, yes.

520
34:05.295 --> 34:08.395
- Is the young lady doing well? - I am risking my life...

521
34:08.465 --> 34:10.165
and doing my best to serve her.

522
34:12.395 --> 34:13.735
Then, this...

523
34:13.795 --> 34:16.165
blank check...

524
34:16.235 --> 34:17.235
When will it be processed?

525
34:23.605 --> 34:25.275
After checking with the finance team,

526
34:25.345 --> 34:28.185
Manager Nam Goong sold 5,000 company shares.

527
34:28.245 --> 34:30.645
That is about 300,000 dollars, so I will find out what is going on.

528
34:30.715 --> 34:34.315
Also, I think we will find young lady soon.

529
34:34.385 --> 34:37.585
Do that without Manager Nam Goong knowing.

530
34:37.655 --> 34:39.125
His...

531
34:40.055 --> 34:41.595
eyes have changed.

532
34:59.945 --> 35:01.645
Are you going to have lunch?

533
35:01.715 --> 35:03.415
I am planning to eat at the cafeteria today.

534
35:03.485 --> 35:04.915
They said tteokbokki is on the menu.

535
35:10.985 --> 35:13.155
Tteokbokki is what Hong Du likes.

536
35:18.735 --> 35:19.735
Wait a minute.

537
35:21.605 --> 35:22.905
Am I...

538
35:22.965 --> 35:24.505
thinking of Hong Du right now?

539
35:26.975 --> 35:28.645
Tae Bong,

540
35:28.705 --> 35:30.505
did you happen to eat flour-based food yesterday?

541
35:31.915 --> 35:33.075
You are so swollen.

542
35:35.245 --> 35:37.085
Is it obvious?

543
35:37.145 --> 35:39.485
You usually do not even drink water before a schedule.

544
35:39.555 --> 35:41.015
These are going to be used as photos...

545
35:41.085 --> 35:42.585
for the overseas interview, so what are you going to do?

546
35:42.655 --> 35:45.295
Even shading cannot cover it. What now?

547
35:47.295 --> 35:48.725
I know...

548
35:48.795 --> 35:50.895
Why did I do that?

549
35:50.965 --> 35:52.735
Why do I keep doing this?

550
35:55.665 --> 35:56.665
(Cha Hong Du)

551
36:01.975 --> 36:02.975
Yes?

552
36:03.045 --> 36:05.345
Well, I am going to wash my father,

553
36:05.415 --> 36:07.545
but someone told me not to touch just anything.

554
36:07.615 --> 36:09.545
Especially the things he cherishes.

555
36:11.415 --> 36:13.585
So,

556
36:13.655 --> 36:16.485
this soap in the bathroom. Is this also something you cherish?

557
36:16.555 --> 36:18.695
You are in my bathroom right now, right?

558
36:18.755 --> 36:20.695
That is my private bathtub, so absolutely...

559
36:22.225 --> 36:24.965
Wait. Wash who?

560
36:38.145 --> 36:41.045
You do not have to come help.

561
36:41.115 --> 36:43.785
I was only going to wash his hair.

562
36:43.845 --> 36:44.845
That girl.

563
36:44.915 --> 36:46.615
You should have said so earlier.

564
36:46.685 --> 36:47.915
Well, what should I do?

565
36:47.985 --> 36:50.855
- Should I do it even now? - I am not okay with it.

566
36:50.925 --> 36:52.695
Are you a pervert? Peeping at someone taking a bath?

567
36:52.755 --> 36:54.655
My Hong Du is not a pervert.

568
37:04.205 --> 37:06.235
When did she...

569
37:06.305 --> 37:09.105
I did not have this in my bathroom.

570
37:09.175 --> 37:12.745
This was all planned. A father-daughter scam.

571
37:12.815 --> 37:13.815
Gosh.

572
37:16.385 --> 37:17.885
Here I go.

573
37:25.355 --> 37:28.725
You have aged a lot, sir.

574
37:28.795 --> 37:30.125
You are listening to me, right?

575
37:31.865 --> 37:32.965
Sir...

576
37:34.135 --> 37:35.705
Are you happy you found your daughter?

577
37:41.205 --> 37:42.205
I am sorry.

578
37:44.205 --> 37:46.875
I know I am doing you a great wrong,

579
37:48.345 --> 37:49.445
but that woman...

580
37:52.055 --> 37:53.285
keeps smiling.

581
37:54.685 --> 37:57.225
What did you say? I cannot hear you.

582
38:00.125 --> 38:04.095
Wow. The dead skin, it is coming off like noodles.

583
38:04.165 --> 38:06.765
Cha Hong Du does not need to make noodle soup.

584
38:08.405 --> 38:11.735
It hurts. You Hong Du Leech.

585
38:11.805 --> 38:14.735
Oh, come on. I told you I am not a Leech.

586
38:14.805 --> 38:17.345
Like father, like daughter, right?

587
38:17.405 --> 38:19.045
What a temper.

588
38:24.085 --> 38:27.385
Do you have any sense? Even if he is your father,

589
38:27.455 --> 38:29.555
you cannot just wash a grown man.

590
38:29.625 --> 38:33.695
Then what should I do? My father is so filthy.

591
38:33.755 --> 38:36.365
From now on, you can do it.

592
38:36.425 --> 38:38.735
I will give you...

593
38:38.795 --> 38:39.795
a full 30 dollars.

594
38:41.165 --> 38:42.705
I cannot do this anymore. I cannot.

595
38:42.705 --> 38:43.705
You,

596
38:43.705 --> 38:45.375
get out of my house right now.

597
38:45.435 --> 38:47.335
Oh, I cannot hear you. I cannot hear you.

598
38:47.405 --> 38:49.345
You might have let us in,

599
38:49.405 --> 38:52.175
- but we will leave when we want to. - Hey, Cha Hong Du.

600
38:52.245 --> 38:53.345
Oh, why are you yelling?

601
38:53.415 --> 38:55.585
- You will startle my father. - No yelling.

602
38:55.645 --> 38:58.455
- You will startle my Hong Du. - Oh, sir.

603
38:58.515 --> 39:01.115
- Why do you keep taking her side... - If you do not want to, fine.

604
39:01.185 --> 39:04.125
They say you should make money while you can.

605
39:04.185 --> 39:07.395
Who knows? You might become a total beggar overnight.

606
39:07.455 --> 39:09.195
When a good gig comes up,

607
39:09.265 --> 39:11.225
it is good to earn some cash in advance.

608
39:12.335 --> 39:14.735
I am crazy.

609
39:18.265 --> 39:19.435
I have no choice.

610
39:19.805 --> 39:22.405
I will just have to wash him myself.

611
39:25.215 --> 39:27.645
Make it 50 dollars, and not a penny less.

612
39:32.515 --> 39:35.625
He is actually negotiating.

613
39:35.685 --> 39:38.495
The rich are always the greediest.

614
39:44.225 --> 39:45.235
But Father,

615
39:46.495 --> 39:48.135
why do you keep calling him a leech?

616
39:49.805 --> 39:52.205
I am the real leech here.

617
39:52.275 --> 39:54.005
We are freeloading at Um Tae Bong's house.

618
39:56.305 --> 39:59.275
He might speak a bit rudely,

619
39:59.345 --> 40:02.745
but he is actually warm and kind.

620
40:02.815 --> 40:04.215
So please be nice to him, Father.

621
40:08.115 --> 40:09.125
And...

622
40:10.555 --> 40:11.555
Um Tae Bong is...

623
40:12.825 --> 40:14.695
sick just like you, Father.

624
40:14.755 --> 40:16.195
If he just gets a kiss,

625
40:16.265 --> 40:18.195
his mind goes blank and he cannot breathe.

626
40:20.195 --> 40:22.665
I do not know why he is like that, but...

627
40:26.335 --> 40:27.335
So...

628
40:28.545 --> 40:29.545
I feel a bit sorry for him.

629
40:47.325 --> 40:50.025
She is talking behind my back again.

630
40:51.495 --> 40:54.765
Oh, come on. I told you I am not a Leech.

631
40:54.835 --> 40:56.635
Like father, like daughter, right?

632
40:56.705 --> 40:59.275
What a temper.

633
40:59.275 --> 41:00.935
Wait,

634
41:00.935 --> 41:02.775
did I just call them father and daughter?

635
41:04.405 --> 41:05.915
Get a grip, Um Tae Bong.

636
41:08.275 --> 41:09.285
Still,

637
41:10.315 --> 41:12.215
I am glad he looks happy.

638
41:13.655 --> 41:14.655
Her, too.

639
41:15.685 --> 41:17.325
Even if it is fake,

640
41:17.325 --> 41:20.695
having someone to call father and daughter...

641
41:20.755 --> 41:21.755
Is that a good thing?

642
41:23.625 --> 41:25.595
(Hyun Joo)

643
41:27.665 --> 41:30.035
You like seafood stew.

644
41:30.105 --> 41:31.365
The blue crabs are really fresh today.

645
41:31.435 --> 41:33.535
No, I do not need to eat.

646
41:33.605 --> 41:37.475
- What? - I mean...

647
41:37.545 --> 41:40.145
I am just not really in the mood for seafood stew today.

648
41:40.215 --> 41:41.675
Oh, really?

649
41:41.745 --> 41:43.815
Then I will make you something else.

650
41:43.885 --> 41:45.685
I bought a bunch of things.

651
41:45.755 --> 41:47.555
No, I am too tired.

652
41:48.685 --> 41:49.685
Seriously, next time.

653
41:50.825 --> 41:51.825
Is that right?

654
41:53.255 --> 41:54.795
Alright, get some rest then.

655
41:54.855 --> 41:56.565
We can have seafood stew next time.

656
41:56.625 --> 41:57.625
Yes.

657
42:15.615 --> 42:17.785
Darn it.

658
42:26.325 --> 42:27.395
I thought you were off today.

659
42:28.625 --> 42:31.395
Dong Seok, could you throw away the stuff in the car?

660
42:31.465 --> 42:32.965
I was going to make seafood stew, but...

661
42:34.435 --> 42:35.605
I guess the seafood was not fresh enough.

662
42:36.665 --> 42:38.135
It already smelled rotten on the way here.

663
42:44.945 --> 42:45.945
Let's see here.

664
42:49.085 --> 42:50.645
These are all Tae Bong's favorites.

665
43:02.965 --> 43:05.935
You idiot.

666
43:07.535 --> 43:08.565
What now?

667
43:19.375 --> 43:20.845
Oh, boy.

668
43:20.915 --> 43:22.815
Please take good care of my father.

669
43:22.885 --> 43:23.985
Oh, do not worry.

670
43:24.045 --> 43:26.015
More importantly, if that punk Tae Bong bothers you,

671
43:26.085 --> 43:27.115
tell me right away.

672
43:27.185 --> 43:28.415
He has a bad case of Celebrity Syndrome.

673
43:30.185 --> 43:32.455
- Celebrity Syndrome? - Celebrity Syndrome, yes.

674
43:32.525 --> 43:33.525
Oh, please.

675
43:35.365 --> 43:37.995
Well then, I hope you remember my loyalty today...

676
43:38.065 --> 43:40.035
in the future.

677
43:40.095 --> 43:41.935
- Good luck. - Good luck.

678
43:42.005 --> 43:43.665
Okay. Have a safe trip.

679
43:47.205 --> 43:48.805
It has been a while since your home was this lively...

680
43:48.875 --> 43:49.875
Feels good, right?

681
43:54.345 --> 43:57.015
Do I look like I feel good?

682
43:58.115 --> 44:00.715
- Right. - How long do we have to keep up...

683
44:00.785 --> 44:03.925
- this Truman Show? - Well, let's see...

684
44:03.985 --> 44:06.555
Until Hong Du's unpredictable brain returns to normal?

685
44:06.625 --> 44:09.325
Or until the day your secret can be revealed to the world...

686
44:09.395 --> 44:12.135
without causing any trouble, right?

687
44:12.195 --> 44:14.235
Hey, so keep a close eye on Hong Du.

688
44:14.295 --> 44:16.065
Do not get caught doing anything weird, okay?

689
44:16.065 --> 44:18.105
Good luck.

690
44:18.165 --> 44:21.735
Gosh, since when did the normal world...

691
44:21.805 --> 44:23.105
become so weird?

692
44:24.875 --> 44:25.875
Good luck.

693
44:32.315 --> 44:34.755
Hey, Do Seon Mi, do you know why he told me not to pick him up...

694
44:34.815 --> 44:36.655
- for the time being? - No.

695
44:36.725 --> 44:38.155
Then my excuse to go inside the house...

696
44:38.225 --> 44:39.625
disappears.

697
44:39.695 --> 44:41.255
- Do you really not know anything? - No.

698
44:41.325 --> 44:42.965
How do you not know a single thing?

699
44:43.025 --> 44:44.025
I know one thing.

700
44:46.395 --> 44:47.935
Be careful.

701
44:58.245 --> 44:59.615
I picked this up on the way...

702
44:59.675 --> 45:02.985
No, I met her. Seon Mi, the outfit?

703
45:03.045 --> 45:04.045
The one for the continuity.

704
45:05.315 --> 45:07.685
- Hello. - Oh, my.

705
45:09.185 --> 45:11.585
- Okay. - Read the scenes in order.

706
45:11.655 --> 45:14.295
- First is scene 39. - Okay, continuity.

707
45:14.355 --> 45:15.695
And scene 42.

708
45:15.765 --> 45:17.765
- This outfit. - Okay.

709
45:18.835 --> 45:20.935
(Favorite Character Is Cha Hong Du From "The Crown Prince's Bodyguard")

710
45:22.505 --> 45:25.065
A ghost!

711
45:28.975 --> 45:29.975
Hey, you...

712
45:31.775 --> 45:34.675
- What are you doing? - Practicing my paper-eating trick.

713
45:34.745 --> 45:36.545
(Practicing My Paper-Eating Trick)

714
45:41.385 --> 45:43.325
Man, it is really good since I have not had it in a while, right?

715
45:46.795 --> 45:50.325
Buy the medicine and open the door wide.

716
45:52.295 --> 45:53.995
- What is wrong with you? - Are you okay?

717
45:54.065 --> 45:55.065
Are you okay?

718
45:57.135 --> 45:58.635
Drink some water.

719
45:58.705 --> 45:59.705
Are you okay?

720
46:02.305 --> 46:03.305
It is too spicy.

721
46:04.745 --> 46:05.745
Please turn off the TV.

722
46:10.585 --> 46:13.355
If you are tired, should I go buy you a cup of coffee?

723
46:13.415 --> 46:15.525
From that cafe you like.

724
46:15.585 --> 46:17.685
Okay. I will run and get it right now.

725
46:17.755 --> 46:18.755
I am fine.

726
46:21.095 --> 46:22.095
He is fine?

727
46:23.225 --> 46:24.225
What is fine?

728
46:25.225 --> 46:26.865
Why is he fine?

729
46:26.935 --> 46:28.495
What is this?

730
46:28.565 --> 46:29.705
Why is he not nagging me?

731
46:31.265 --> 46:33.275
Nagging means love?

732
46:34.735 --> 46:36.805
You think you have only been nagged all this time?

733
46:36.875 --> 46:38.705
That was all love.

734
46:39.775 --> 46:41.545
Though it is shifting to someone else now.

735
46:41.615 --> 46:44.745
Hey, is love some kind of virus? Why would it shift around?

736
46:44.815 --> 46:46.385
What would a kid like you know?

737
46:46.455 --> 46:48.985
That it is the most fatal virus in the world.

738
46:49.055 --> 46:50.725
We have lots of car scenes today, so there's a ton of work,

739
46:50.785 --> 46:52.425
and even reporters are here. I am exhausted.

740
46:52.495 --> 46:55.025
- I am exhausted. - Reporters?

741
46:55.095 --> 46:56.295
- Yes. - Hello.

742
46:57.365 --> 47:00.495
We are only going to overlay music for this scene.

743
47:00.565 --> 47:03.135
Just improvise the lines to create a sorrowful mood.

744
47:05.305 --> 47:06.875
What are you doing later?

745
47:06.935 --> 47:09.545
A new spicy chicken feet place opened in Cheongdam-dong.

746
47:09.605 --> 47:11.405
- Want to go? - These days, I am...

747
47:13.015 --> 47:14.415
doing intermittent fasting.

748
47:16.315 --> 47:17.885
The car keys are in the ignition,

749
47:19.585 --> 47:21.215
so I really want to skip the shoot and go.

750
47:24.255 --> 47:25.285
This right now...

751
47:27.155 --> 47:29.125
is a very sad scene.

752
47:29.195 --> 47:30.195
Are you going to keep...

753
47:31.665 --> 47:33.635
talking nonsense?

754
47:33.695 --> 47:35.335
What does it matter?

755
47:35.395 --> 47:38.005
They will just play music over it and only show the visuals anyway.

756
47:38.065 --> 47:40.675
The emotion is great right now.

757
47:40.735 --> 47:42.205
See? He says it is great.

758
47:45.245 --> 47:47.345
What? Reporter Yeo Mi Ran is here.

759
47:56.885 --> 47:59.555
I do not know how Reporter Yeo Mi Ran caught on,

760
47:59.625 --> 48:02.695
but she knows that Hong Du knows your secret.

761
48:02.765 --> 48:05.665
She is going to find Hong Du and make her talk.

762
48:13.535 --> 48:14.535
(Restricted Area)

763
48:15.575 --> 48:16.575
What should I do?

764
48:18.805 --> 48:20.645
- Get out. - What?

765
48:20.715 --> 48:22.585
Get out right now, hurry.

766
48:31.655 --> 48:32.655
Wait...

767
48:34.155 --> 48:36.065
Oh, hey!

768
48:37.125 --> 48:38.395
Where are you going?

769
48:38.465 --> 48:43.365
- Wow, impressive. - Is Um Tae Bong out of his mind?

770
48:44.765 --> 48:46.635
I will write and send an article right now.

771
48:46.705 --> 48:47.705
Let us go.

772
48:58.515 --> 49:03.655
(Scandal Maker Um Tae Bong Even Deserts the Set)

773
49:08.455 --> 49:12.795
Where are you? The director is mad and the set is a total mess.

774
49:12.865 --> 49:16.535
Bravo. Have you finally lost your mind?

775
49:19.575 --> 49:21.275
(CEO Park)

776
49:23.505 --> 49:24.505
Yes?

777
49:24.505 --> 49:26.375
I heard Reporter Yeo Mi Ran showed up on set.

778
49:26.445 --> 49:28.415
For now, I said you got a call that your mother is critical...

779
49:28.475 --> 49:32.315
and acted impulsively, so play along if anyone asks.

780
49:35.825 --> 49:36.825
Oh, okay.

781
49:36.885 --> 49:38.085
Worst case scenario, let us say my secret...

782
49:38.155 --> 49:39.625
is completely exposed because of Cha Hong Du.

783
49:39.695 --> 49:41.225
So what?

784
49:41.295 --> 49:42.765
It means a hiatus or a downfall.

785
49:43.865 --> 49:44.865
It has to be one or the other.

786
49:47.395 --> 49:49.405
Did you go use the bathroom during the shoot?

787
49:49.465 --> 49:51.265
Stop hanging up and get here quickly.

788
49:54.135 --> 49:55.135
Then,

789
49:56.875 --> 49:58.975
she will realize that she is weird too.

790
50:00.275 --> 50:01.375
Darn it.

791
50:02.745 --> 50:05.315
Right? The best friend Tae Bong talked about on that show.

792
50:06.555 --> 50:09.655
But does he not look like a childhood dream crusher?

793
50:13.625 --> 50:16.165
You have been coming every day since last week.

794
50:18.065 --> 50:19.365
One ramyeon a day...

795
50:21.795 --> 50:23.635
will make you gain weight.

796
50:23.705 --> 50:25.705
From now on, only come exactly three times a week.

797
50:25.775 --> 50:26.775
- What? - What?

798
50:28.835 --> 50:31.245
Wow, he is telling a customer not to come.

799
50:31.305 --> 50:34.145
I know, right? Oh, he is so charming.

800
50:34.215 --> 50:35.375
I will bring you a menu. Just a moment.

801
50:35.445 --> 50:36.545
Hey, I call dibs on him.

802
50:40.215 --> 50:42.755
By the way, when did you become a fan of Um Tae Bong?

803
50:42.825 --> 50:45.055
Since the day he received the Brave Citizen Award...

804
50:45.125 --> 50:48.055
and was on the news for the first time?

805
50:48.125 --> 50:49.625
True, what would have happened to Um Tae Bong...

806
50:49.695 --> 50:52.395
- if that incident never happened? - Exactly.

807
50:53.065 --> 50:55.735
- Hey, did I gain weight? - No, not at all.

808
51:04.575 --> 51:05.575
Wait, this is...

809
51:12.185 --> 51:13.355
This is so annoying.

810
51:13.415 --> 51:14.815
What time did they say our shoot starts?

811
51:14.885 --> 51:17.085
I had no schedule today, so I was going to touch up my roots.

812
51:17.155 --> 51:18.425
This is all because of Um Tae Bong.

813
51:18.485 --> 51:19.855
Because he bailed on the shoot yesterday.

814
51:21.455 --> 51:22.525
I see.

815
51:23.665 --> 51:26.095
Well, sometimes actors face situations...

816
51:26.165 --> 51:27.235
that are out of their control.

817
51:28.835 --> 51:30.365
Are you defending that jerk right now?

818
51:31.365 --> 51:34.775
What? When did I do that? I am thirsty. I want some water.

819
51:36.005 --> 51:38.305
Stay here. I will get some right now.

820
51:42.175 --> 51:44.185
Gosh.

821
51:56.695 --> 51:58.295
I am a fan of yours, Na Ri.

822
51:58.365 --> 52:00.365
Can we take one picture together, please?

823
52:00.435 --> 52:02.435
Well, when my manager gets back...

824
52:02.505 --> 52:06.305
Come on, just take one picture with me, please?

825
52:06.375 --> 52:08.235
Just think of me as your older brother.

826
52:09.445 --> 52:12.445
- You are so pretty. - Get your hand off her right now.

827
52:16.315 --> 52:18.545
In your family, do you grab your younger sister by the waist...

828
52:18.615 --> 52:22.585
- and hug her like that? - I am a fan of Song Na Ri.

829
52:22.655 --> 52:23.655
What, can a celebrity not...

830
52:23.725 --> 52:26.995
- do this much for a fan? - No, she cannot.

831
52:27.055 --> 52:28.995
Did you get permission from Song Na Ri?

832
52:29.055 --> 52:30.295
If not, you should apologize first.

833
52:30.365 --> 52:31.365
I do not want to.

834
52:31.865 --> 52:35.235
I was taught to hug my younger sister...

835
52:35.235 --> 52:37.565
even tighter by the waist.

836
52:37.635 --> 52:38.635
What?

837
52:38.705 --> 52:41.475
- You son of a... - What? Son of a? You little.

838
52:41.535 --> 52:44.245
That is not a dog, that is a dung fly.

839
52:44.305 --> 52:47.575
Hey, little ones, do you see this?

840
52:47.645 --> 52:50.615
A dung fly flew in during our filming break.

841
52:51.845 --> 52:54.255
Um Tae Bong, are you saying that to me...

842
52:54.315 --> 52:56.625
Wow, the dung fly is talking.

843
52:56.685 --> 52:58.485
- Are you serious right now? - Oh!

844
52:58.555 --> 53:00.025
You think you're all that because you're a star?

845
53:00.095 --> 53:02.025
Whose permission did you get to film my face?

846
53:02.095 --> 53:03.895
Did you get her permission to grab her waist?

847
53:06.665 --> 53:07.965
No, well...

848
53:11.835 --> 53:14.835
I am sorry. That was my fault. No, it is just...

849
53:14.905 --> 53:17.805
I really love your dramas, so much,

850
53:17.875 --> 53:19.945
so I just tried copying what you do in them.

851
53:21.775 --> 53:22.815
I do not think so.

852
53:22.885 --> 53:25.385
I have never done that in reality or in my dramas.

853
53:25.445 --> 53:27.015
Grabbing a woman by the waist without permission,

854
53:27.085 --> 53:28.755
pushing her against a wall to kiss her,

855
53:28.815 --> 53:31.325
forcibly turning her around and hugging her against her will.

856
53:31.385 --> 53:34.855
The era of considering that attractive has passed, has it not?

857
53:43.135 --> 53:47.535
Oh, Um Tae Bong is totally a modern man.

858
53:49.775 --> 53:52.645
True, dramas have ruined everything.

859
53:52.715 --> 53:54.445
Making people think being macho is cool.

860
53:55.475 --> 53:59.115
The problem is that those are all famous scenes.

861
54:00.155 --> 54:01.915
Oh, my heart is pounding.

862
54:01.985 --> 54:03.555
Romance is definitely my true calling.

863
54:03.625 --> 54:05.525
Action does not suit me at all.

864
54:05.585 --> 54:07.895
What if he brings his friends? Should I call the police?

865
54:08.925 --> 54:11.825
Do not worry. You have me.

866
54:11.895 --> 54:13.195
That is why I am even more worried.

867
54:30.085 --> 54:31.085
Do not smile like that.

868
54:32.655 --> 54:34.215
How am I smiling?

869
54:34.285 --> 54:35.315
Your smile looks ugly.

870
54:37.155 --> 54:38.785
Oh, man.

871
54:38.855 --> 54:40.155
Anyway...

872
54:40.225 --> 54:41.325
You were pretty cool earlier.

873
54:42.455 --> 54:46.035
I will be generous. Stay right here.

874
54:46.095 --> 54:47.265
I'll go get us something cold.

875
54:48.265 --> 54:49.735
(Filming The Cocky Detective and Con Artist)

876
54:50.735 --> 54:51.735
Let's go together.

877
55:09.425 --> 55:10.925
What was that?

878
55:10.985 --> 55:12.555
Don't tell me...

879
55:12.625 --> 55:14.725
No, what was that?

880
55:14.795 --> 55:17.525
- It's okay, I'm not hurt. - You scared me.

881
55:17.595 --> 55:19.095
Darn it.

882
55:20.265 --> 55:24.505
That punk. What am I going to do?

883
55:24.565 --> 55:25.605
We need to know who it is...

884
55:25.665 --> 55:28.635
before we can do anything. Darn it.

885
55:28.705 --> 55:30.175
They have completely lost their minds.

886
55:30.245 --> 55:31.675
They followed us all the way to the set. Darn it.

887
55:31.745 --> 55:33.645
What are we supposed to do about this? Darn it.

888
55:33.715 --> 55:37.345
More importantly, I was missing something crucial.

889
55:37.415 --> 55:38.415
What?

890
55:38.485 --> 55:40.885
If Cha Hong Du lives in a fake world...

891
55:42.855 --> 55:43.925
now I...

892
55:47.455 --> 55:49.865
need a real bodyguard.

893
55:51.425 --> 55:52.425
Oh my.

894
56:05.675 --> 56:06.675
Oh, really?

895
56:08.275 --> 56:09.275
A punk who can't even drink...

896
56:09.345 --> 56:12.115
doesn't want to go to a bar or your house.

897
56:12.185 --> 56:13.685
What's this secret?

898
56:17.725 --> 56:18.725
Seriously?

899
56:32.335 --> 56:33.335
From now on...

900
56:35.705 --> 56:37.105
listen to me carefully.

901
56:48.755 --> 56:50.025
What kind of nonsense is that?

902
56:53.155 --> 56:56.465
Seriously, you too? Again. Darn it.

903
56:56.525 --> 56:58.925
What I mean is this. Listen carefully.

904
56:58.995 --> 57:03.165
Cha Hong Du thinks she's the real protagonist...

905
57:03.235 --> 57:05.665
and the fake bodyguard...

906
57:05.735 --> 57:08.875
So the real isn't real...

907
57:08.935 --> 57:12.875
and I need the real one. That is what I am saying. Darn it.

908
57:12.945 --> 57:15.575
Hey, you really get it now, right?

909
57:17.815 --> 57:18.815
Right?

910
57:20.115 --> 57:21.815
You are talking complete nonsense.

911
57:23.085 --> 57:25.025
Hey, don't ever touch alcohol again.

912
57:26.085 --> 57:27.155
A punk getting wasted on two glasses,

913
57:27.225 --> 57:28.855
Seriously.

914
57:28.925 --> 57:30.165
That is my point!

915
57:30.225 --> 57:35.265
- I'm asking you to be my bodyguard. - No.

916
57:35.335 --> 57:36.465
- No? - No.

917
57:36.535 --> 57:39.875
No? Why not? Darn it.

918
57:39.935 --> 57:43.845
- Hey, I'm asking you to help me. - Because there's someone else...

919
57:43.905 --> 57:45.475
I need to protect.

920
57:47.775 --> 57:50.285
Who? Who besides me?

921
57:50.345 --> 57:53.815
- Who is in more danger than me? - There is.

922
57:56.525 --> 57:57.925
Someone who's in a lot of danger right now.

923
57:59.555 --> 58:01.525
Oh, this punk.

924
58:01.595 --> 58:04.095
